  "description": "A C# Source Generator that embeds file contents directly into your code at compile time. Use the [FileImport] attribute to automatically generate partial properties or fields containing strings, byte arrays, ReadOnlySpans, Base64, or Streams from external files. Perfect for embedding scripts (Lua, SQL), configuration files (JSON, XML), or binary data without runtime I/O overhead or reflection. Requires adding target files as <AdditionalFiles> in your .csproj.",
